Acknowledged, nothing copied
  - scientific-figure-making is a fresh adaptation of the workflow described in
    Chen Liu's figures4papers (CC BY-NC 4.0, https://github.com/ChenLiu-1996/figures4papers).
    No file from that repository is copied; its licence is non-commercial, which
    is why only the ideas are used.
  - generating-scientific-hypotheses and co-scientist-tournament implement
    methods from Gottweis et al., "Accelerating scientific discovery with
    Co-Scientist", Nature (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10644-y
