    scientific discovery", Nature (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10652-y.
    No paper text is copied. co-scientist-tournament also ports the algorithms of
    raktim-mondol/co-scientist (MIT License, (c) 2025 Raktim Mondol).
